 "titulo": "How a tree root lifts a slab of concrete 🌳 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "ROOTS LIFT CONCRETE",
 "descripcion": "A tree root is soft, but it never stops growing. Under a sidewalk it finds water, gets thicker every year, and lifts slabs that weigh hundreds of kilos.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #science #shorts",
